        80.59070587158203,
        527.4409790039062,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "summary of data on potential reproductive toxicity of pretomanid. No additional research data were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        323.1764221191406,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "available during review of sub-PICO questions 3.2–3.5.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        124.63459014892578,
        188.5621337890625,
        140.29458618164062
      ],
      "text": "Pharmacokinetic data",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        147.5025177001953,
        527.435546875,
        161.9455108642578
      ],
      "text": "Early data from the pharmacokinetics study embedded in the TB-PRACTECAL were presented to the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        160.70252990722656,
        527.4235229492188,
        175.14552307128906
      ],
      "text": "GDG panel in one of the preparatory webinars. The final results of this sub-study were not available",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        173.9025421142578,
        367.0224609375,
        188.3455352783203
      ],
      "text": "at the time of the assessment and could not be fully considered.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        195.6063995361328,
        527.4290161132812,
        210.0493927001953
      ],
      "text": "The pharmacokinetics of linezolid are highly variable, with efficacy and toxicity dependent on factors",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        208.80641174316406,
        527.548583984375,
        223.24940490722656
      ],
      "text": "such as pathogen susceptibility, drug exposure and the combination of companion drugs. The toxicity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.978679656982422,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        222.0063018798828,
        527.3914794921875,
        236.4492950439453
      ],
      "text": "of linezolid, especially when used at higher doses and longer durations, is a known phenomenon",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        235.20643615722656,
        527.0957641601562,
        249.64942932128906
      ],
      "text": "and various strategies have been suggested to reduce it. However, except for the data available from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995749473571777,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        248.4064483642578,
        517.4983520507812,
        262.8494567871094
      ],
      "text": "the ZeNix and TB-PRACTECAL trials, no other strategies have been tested in a trial environment. 27",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.25018310546875,
        310.49530029296875,
        294.9101867675781
      ],
      "text": "Data on reproductive toxicity of pretomanid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        302.11822509765625,
        527.5604248046875,
        316.5612487792969
      ],
      "text": "New data on the safety of pretomanid based on hormone evaluations in four clinical trials and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        315.31817626953125,
        527.5764770507812,
        329.7611999511719
      ],
      "text": "a paternity survey were assessed; these data have largely alleviated previous concerns about",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        328.5182189941406,
        527.434814453125,
        342.96124267578125
      ],
      "text": "reproductive toxicities observed in animal studies,  suggesting that adverse effects on human male  28",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        341.71820068359375,
        527.4200439453125,
        356.1612243652344
      ],
      "text": "fertility are unlikely. A study assessing semen in men undergoing treatment that includes pretomanid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        354.918212890625,
        527.4542236328125,
        369.3612365722656
      ],
      "text": "is in progress and will address any remaining concerns. Below is a summary of preclinical and clinical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        368.1181945800781,
        291.9221496582031,
        382.56121826171875
      ],
      "text": "data relevant to testicular toxicity of pretomanid:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        389.8221130371094,
        78.23609924316406,
        404.26513671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        389.8221130371094,
        371.2399597167969,
        404.26513671875
      ],
      "text": "rodent toxicology studies – evidence of direct testicular toxicity;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        403.0220947265625,
        78.23609924316406,
        417.4651184082031
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        403.0220947265625,
        527.4334716796875,
        417.4651184082031
      ],
      "text": "monkey toxicology studies – no evidence for direct testicular toxicity; abnormal sperm findings",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        416.22210693359375,
        355.2955017089844,
        430.6651306152344
      ],
      "text": "considered to be secondary to declining physical condition;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        429.422119140625,
        78.23609924316406,
        443.8651428222656
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        429.422119140625,
        527.4312133789062,
        443.8651428222656
      ],
      "text": "hormone data from clinical studies – no changes in follicle stimulating hormone (FSH), luteinizing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        442.6221008300781,
        363.677490234375,
        457.06512451171875
      ],
      "text": "hormone (LH) and inhibin B, consistent with testicular toxicity;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        455.8221130371094,
        78.23609924316406,
        470.26513671875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
