      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        482.22210693359375,
        499.6869812011719,
        496.6651306152344
      ],
      "text": "semen study – ongoing study evaluating semen in men undergoing pretomanid treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        513.0659790039062,
        300.21014404296875,
        528.7260131835938
      ],
      "text": "Resources required and cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.9338989257812,
        527.30322265625,
        550.3768920898438
      ],
      "text": "Estimated regimen costs (in adults) at GDF prices  are about US$ 688 for BPaL (600–26), US$ 716 for  29",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996199607849121,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        549.1339111328125,
        527.3872680664062,
        563.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "BPaLM (600–26), an average of US$ 771 for longer regimens (depends on length and composition)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        562.3338623046875,
        527.3945922851562,
        576.77685546875
      ],
      "text": "and US$ 535–557 for 9-month regimens. Data from three studies were available on more detailed",
