    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        575.533935546875,
        527.5656127929688,
        589.9769287109375
      ],
      "text": "analyses of resources required and cost–effectiveness; two of these studies compared the BPaL",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        587.4578857421875,
        527.4412231445312,
        603.1768798828125
      ],
      "text": "(34, 35) regimen with longer (18-month) regimens   and one compared the BPaL, BPaLM and BPaLC",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        600.6580200195312,
        527.4014892578125,
        616.3770141601562
      ],
      "text": "(36) regimens with longer (18-month) regimens and with the 9-month regimen with ethionamide  . The",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.969407081604004,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        615.1339111328125,
        527.4389038085938,
        629.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "applicability of the results from these studies varied by PICO and sub-PICO question, and the panel",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        628.3339233398438,
        527.37939453125,
        642.7769165039062
      ],
      "text": "noted associated caveats when discussing these results (details available in the GRADE EtD tables in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
