      "size": 10.984289169311523,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        654.73388671875,
        527.1085815429688,
        669.1768798828125
      ],
      "text": "delivery) within country appear to be between 1.4-fold and 6-fold higher (longer regimens) or 1–18%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.975472450256348,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        667.9340209960938,
        527.453125,
        682.3770141601562
      ],
      "text": "higher (9-month regimens) than for BPaLM/BPaL. Thus, the panel judged that implementation of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        681.1339111328125,
        527.5702514648438,
        695.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "BPaLM/BPaL would probably to lead to large savings when replacing the longer (18-month) regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.978328704833984,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        694.3339233398438,
        356.87615966796875,
        708.7769165039062
      ],
      "text": "and moderate savings when replacing the 9-month regimens.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        715.4025268554688,
        519.9967651367188,
        729.1065063476562
      ],
      "text": "As presented in the expert review (by Dr J-W. Alffenaar, University of Sydney) to the GDG panel in one of the preparatory webinars.  27",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        727.8370971679688,
        380.3623046875,
        741.5410766601562
      ],
      "text": "Pretomanid has been shown to cause testicular atrophy and impaired fertility in male rats. 28",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        740.2718505859375,
        526.7682495117188,
        753.9757690429688
      ],
      "text": "Estimated regimen prices were calculated using the average weighted price for each medicine (average weighted price accounts for the  29",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 7.989743232727051,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86620330810547,
        753.0718383789062,
        526.3069458007812,
        763.5758056640625
      ],
      "text": "different prices for each supplier of that medicine weighted by the market share allocation received from each GDF tender), the duration",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 7.987139701843262,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86620330810547,
        762.6718139648438,
        516.6856079101562,
        773.17578125
      ],
      "text": "indicated (in months) and assuming 30 days of treatment per month. Actual final costs may differ based on the products delivered.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
